<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Bakelite - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Bakelite - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 60.56		vs	   63.56</p>
<p> Operating	    4.17		vs	    3.90</p>
<p> Current		4.81		vs	    4.73</p>
<p> Net		    3.08		vs	    3.01</p>
<p> EPS		   13.45 yen	  vs	   13.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    230 million	  vs	 228 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Bakelite Co Ltd is an integrated processor of synthetic resins and a member of the Sumitomo Chemical group.</p>
</text>
